<title>USA: Noblesville EDIBC, Ind., won by City Securities.</title>
<headline>Noblesville EDIBC, Ind., won by City Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Securities Corp. said it won $2.800 million of  Noblesville Economic Development Infrastructure Building Corp., Ind., COIT lease rental bonds of 1995, with a net interest cost of 5.693 percent.</p>
</text>
